        <item>
            <title>1.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 20:53:30 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>39</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Dilo 1.4.0</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>A new look:</strong> Dilo's navy and glowing bars now live inside the app too: the panel while it listens, the welcome window and Settings &gt; License. Better contrast, larger small text and more of the interface translated.</li>
  <li><strong>Voice pill:</strong> a small floating pill shows when Dilo is listening, transcribing or done ("Pasted in Slack"), right where you are looking. It never takes focus from the app you are typing in. Turn it off or move it to the top in Settings &gt; General.</li>
  <li><strong>Start buttons:</strong> Dictate, Meeting and Voice note buttons in the panel and in the menu bar icon menu (right-click), plus Record in the Vault. The shortcuts still work as before.</li>
  <li><strong>Paste the last one:</strong> when idle, the panel shows your last dictation with a Paste button.</li>
  <li><strong>Vault:</strong> one toolbar for meetings, notes and dictations (favorite, share, export, copy), a clearer header that shows where each new summary was generated, and icons in the sidebar.</li>
  <li><strong>Settings in 6 tabs:</strong> permissions now live in General &gt; Status, and Notes, Ask and Voices moved to Meetings.</li>
  <li>A single menu bar icon that changes with each state and respects Reduce Motion.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
