        <item>
            <title>0.13.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:21:53 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>33</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.13.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Dilo 0.13.0</h2>
<p>The first public release of Dilo. Signed and notarized by Apple.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Dilo Basic is free:</strong> dictate with the fn key in any app, in 19 languages, fully on your Mac.</li>
  <li><strong>Dilo Pro:</strong> meetings without bots, voice notes, Ask your meetings, AI cleanup, ten voice commands, the built-in local AI model and export. One payment, every future version included. Paste your key in Settings &gt; License.</li>
  <li><strong>Automatic updates:</strong> Dilo now checks for new versions on its own and never interrupts a dictation or a meeting to install. You can also use Check for Updates in the menu bar icon.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
